16:["$","p","6",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Professional invoicing also helps your own records. A service business may need to check which invoices are unpaid. A contractor may need to separate labor and material rows. A freelancer may need invoice PDFs for client records. A GST business may need GSTIN, taxable value, CGST, SGST or IGST details. These are hard to manage with casual messages or screenshots."}]]}]
